(35,'According to the reading, which is true?（according to 根據）',['Three-toed sloths look green because there is trichophilus in their hair.','Sloth moths live and die in the sloths’ poop.','We can easily find trichophilus in a park.','Sloth moths lay eggs in the hair of the sloths because it is warm and good for the eggs.'],[],len(PS)-1),
