(41,'Who failed to read through the notice and didn’t follow the rules?',['Mike. After he entered his house, he opened all the windows and doors right away.','Kyle. He sent his two cats to a friend’s place on the early morning of July 28th.','Monica. Before the spraying, she put all her cups and bowls into a drawer.','Jessie. She kept her bedroom closed and didn’t let anyone get into it during the spraying.'],[],len(PS)-1),
